WEBVTT

00:02:00.284 --> 00:02:02.398
I was still only 31 years old.

00:02:03.262 --> 00:02:05.059
Of course, power was sweet.

00:02:05.588 --> 00:02:07.498
I felt invulnerable.

00:02:08.132 --> 00:02:12.881
I had thousands of heavily armed men

00:02:12.905 --> 00:02:15.092
and aircraft at my command.

00:02:15.905 --> 00:02:18.163
I was heavily protected,

00:02:18.187 --> 00:02:20.262
and I lived in luxury.

00:02:21.021 --> 00:02:25.026
But my obligations to my nation
were always superior.

00:02:25.814 --> 00:02:29.599
Millions of fellow citizens
were either displaced

00:02:29.623 --> 00:02:32.922
or fleeing the violence
and pillage of war.